<title>USA: TCW/DW adjourns annual meeting.</title>
<headline>TCW/DW adjourns annual meeting.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>TCW/DW Emerging Markets Opportunities Trust said Tuesday it had adjourned its annual meeting until July 22 with respect to proposals for converting the trust to an open-end investment company from a closed-end investment company.</p>
<p>The trust said the meeting was adjourned because an insufficient number of shareholders were present in person or by proxy to constitute a quorum.</p>
<p>It said approval the proposals is necessary for conversion to an open-end investment company.</p>
</text>
